WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.121
Step 1. Open the Files tab.

1.2
00:00:02.121 --> 00:00:07.802
You can record audio with the microphone of your device and upload it to a patient

1.3
00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:12.528
or to an encounter. Open either one and select the Files tab.

2.1
00:00:12.528 --> 00:00:17.766
Step 2. Open the recorder. Select Add Files, then Record Audio.

2.2
00:00:17.766 --> 00:00:22.145
Care opens the recorder with a microphone button.

3.1
00:00:22.145 --> 00:00:26.445
Step 3. Start the recording. Select the microphone button.

3.2
00:00:26.445 --> 00:00:29.658
Care starts to record only when you select it.

3.3
00:00:29.658 --> 00:00:34.278
If the browser asks for access to the microphone, allow it.

4.1
00:00:34.278 --> 00:00:36.322
Step 4. Stop the recording.

4.2
00:00:36.322 --> 00:00:41.773
Speak into the microphone while the recorder shows Recording and the time that has

4.3
00:00:41.773 --> 00:00:45.929
passed. To stop, select the button that shows the time.

5.1
00:00:45.929 --> 00:00:48.576
Step 5. Listen to the recording.

5.2
00:00:48.576 --> 00:00:52.920
The recorder shows Audio Recorded and plays the recording.

5.3
00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:56.192
Use the player to listen to it again.

6.1
00:00:56.192 --> 00:00:59.755
Step 6. Keep the recording or record again.

6.2
00:00:59.755 --> 00:01:03.608
Select Done to keep it and open the upload dialog,

6.3
00:01:03.608 --> 00:01:07.344
or select Start Again for a new recording.

7.1
00:01:07.344 --> 00:01:10.460
Step 7. Name and upload the recording.

7.2
00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:15.888
Enter a name in the File Name field, which is required and starts empty.

7.3
00:01:15.888 --> 00:01:17.821
Then select Upload.
